title: Browser history flooded
severity: medium
score: 20
tags: scam, browser-hijack
attack: T1185
description: The page flooded session history (many pushState/replaceState calls): back-
  button hijacking used by browser lockers.
---
// 20 or more history entries pushed or replaced: a page that traps the Back button.
capture
| extend entries = toscalar(browser_apis
                            | where api in ("history.pushState", "history.replaceState")
                            | summarize sum(calls))
| where entries >= 20
| project entries
